IMPORTANT — this MIT license covers the source code in this repository only.

The compiled Windows binaries distributed on the Releases page are a different
matter: they link FFmpeg built with --enable-gpl --enable-libx264, and x264 is
GPL-2.0-or-later. Linking it makes the resulting executable a combined work
under the GNU General Public License, so the binaries are distributed under
GPL-3.0-or-later (full text in LICENSE-GPL-3.0.txt), not under MIT.

In short: our source is MIT, any binary built from it and distributed is GPL.
See the "许可证" section of README.md for the details.
